L('Orders leh transaction history','Orders tab-ah completed virtual buy/sell transaction a lang. Each record-ah company, side, quantity, execution price, order value leh date a awm. History chu newest first a ni.~Transaction record hian trade discipline enfiah a pui. Buy/sell vawi tam hnu transaction count, total cash movement leh timing en thei. Reset trading chuan transaction history clear a, lesson progress erawh a vawn.','Transaction history: completed orders. Reset trading: trades clear, progress vawn.','Buy TL 2 @ Ã¢â€šÂ¹125 leh Sell TL 1 @ Ã¢â€šÂ¹150 chuan 2 records, newest sell first.','History delete hnu record awm lo. Reset chuan lesson progress a delete lo tih hriat a pawimawh.','History chu audit trail a ni.',[Q('Orders tab a show chu?','Completed trades','Pending orders','Virtual completed.','Pending a ni lo.'),Q('History order chu?','Newest first','Oldest first','Recent top.','Oldest first a ni lo.'),Q('Reset trading hnu?','Trades clear, progress vawn','All clear','Progress protected.','Progress delete lo.')]);
