L('Small capital-a zir tan dan','Ã¢â€šÂ¹1,000 aia tlem sum hmanga zir tan chuan objective chu profit ngei ni lovin process zir a ni. Quantity tlem, company tlem, trade vawi tlem, record vawn.~Small capital hian mistake cost a tihtlem. Position size tlawm chuan emotional pressure a tlahniam. Fee/charges real account-ah a awm thei tih hriat a pawimawh. Practice-ah charges awm lo mah se risk discipline a zirpui.','Small capital: tlawm sum hmanga practice. Position size: trade amount.','Ã¢â€šÂ¹800 virtual balance, 2 shares @ Ã¢â€šÂ¹250 = Ã¢â€šÂ¹500 trade; balance Ã¢â€šÂ¹300.','Small sum hian real profit ngei beisei suh. Cost basis ignore chuan wrong expectation.','Process zir hmasak, profit beisei loh.',[Q('Small capital objective chu?','Process zir','Profit ngei','Discipline building.','Profit guarantee lo.'),Q('Quantity tlawm hian?','Mistake cost tlawm','Return tam','Risk control.','Return a tiam lo.'),Q('Real account-ah?','Charges awm thei','Charges awm lo','Fees possible.','Zero charges a ni lo.')]);
L('Goal leh time horizon','Goal chu short-term profit emaw long-term wealth emaw a ni thei. Time horizon hian risk tolerance leh company thlan a nghawng. Short horizon chuan price volatility a tuar zawk.~Ã¢â€šÂ¹900 i neih chuan goal realistic a ngai. 3 thla chhunga double beisei chu unrealistic. Goal ziak la, date leh amount chiang. Review hnu chauh strategy thlak rawh.','Time horizon: investment hun rei. Goal: tum.','Goal: 12 thla chhunga process zir; capital Ã¢â€šÂ¹900, monthly review.','Unrealistic goal chuan overtrading. Goal ziak loh chuan random trade.','Goal realistic leh time horizon chiang.',[Q('Short horizon chuan?','Volatility tuar zawk','Risk bo','Price swing a awm.','Risk a bo lo.'),Q('Goal chiang a ngai em?','A ngai','A ngai lo','Direction a pe.','Random trading a awm.'),Q('Unrealistic goal result?','Overtrading','Safety','Pressure a pung.','Safety a ni lo.')]);
L('Budget leh emergency sum','Investment hma mamawh sum, emergency fund, leh debt en rawh. Mamawh sum invest suh. Emergency sum dah hran chuan forced sell a pumpelh.~Ã¢â€šÂ¹1,000 total sum a awm chuan Ã¢â€šÂ¹700 mamawh, Ã¢â€šÂ¹300 invest theih. Company hre lo la Ã¢â€šÂ¹300 pawh nghah theih. Cash vawnna pawh plan nei tur a ni.','Emergency fund: mamawh sum. Budget: available invest sum.','Ã¢â€šÂ¹1,000 total, Ã¢â€šÂ¹700 mamawh, Ã¢â€šÂ¹300 invest candidate.','Mamawh sum invest chuan loss-ah financial stress. Emergency fund bo chuan forced liquidation.','Mamawh sum vawn hmasak.',[Q('Mamawh sum invest tur em?','A ni lo','A ni','Emergency a ngai.','Risk high.'),Q('Emergency fund hian?','Forced sell pumpelh','Return guarantee','Liquidity a pe.','Return a tiam lo.'),Q('Ã¢â€šÂ¹1,000-Ã¢â€šÂ¹700 la awm?','Ã¢â€šÂ¹300','Ã¢â€šÂ¹700','Available invest.','Mamawh a ni.')]);
L('Company thlan tur chhut','Company thlan hma revenue, profit, debt, industry leh management en rawh. Famous name chauh en suh. Small capital chuan company 1-2 chauh thlang la, monitor thei.~Ã¢â€šÂ¹900 capital-ah 5 company sem chuan monitoring a harsa. Company hriatthiam loh chuan invest luih suh. Red flags en: debt sang, profit tlem, management issue.','Company selection: fundamentals en. Red flags: warning signs.','Ã¢â€šÂ¹900 capital, 2 company thlang; each ~Ã¢â€šÂ¹450. Monitor weekly.','Famous name chauh en chuan weak fundamentals miss. Over-diversification small capital-ah a harsa.','Hriat company thlang rawh.',[Q('Famous name chauh en chu?','Risk','Safety','Fundamentals ngai.','Name chauh a ni lo.'),Q('Small capital company count?','1-2','10','Monitor thei.','Too many.'),Q('Red flags chu?','Warning signs','Profit proof','Risk indicate.','Profit proof lo.')]);
L('Charges leh fees','Real trading-ah brokerage, taxes, exchange fees leh slippage a awm thei. Paper Trading-ah charges awm lo mah se real account-ah profit a tihtlem thei.~Ã¢â€šÂ¹1,000 trade-ah fee Ã¢â€šÂ¹20 chauh pawh percentage-ah a lian. Frequent trading chuan fees a pung. Charges hriat hma chuan profit expectation realistic a ngai.','Charges: fees/taxes. Slippage: expected price-a execute loh.','Ã¢â€šÂ¹1,000 trade, Ã¢â€šÂ¹20 fee = 2%. 10 trades chuan 20% cost.','Charges ignore chuan profit expectation wrong. Frequent trading chuan fees a pung.','Charges en hma profit expectation.',[Q('Real trading-ah charges?','A awm','Aw mlo','Fees/taxes.','Zero charges lo.'),Q('Small trade-ah fee impact?','Percentage-ah lian','No impact','Relative cost.','Impact a awm.'),Q('Frequent trading result?','Fees pung','Fees tlahniam','Cost accumulates.','Fees a tlahniam lo.')]);
L('Diversification tlawm','Diversification tih chu sum company hrangah sem darh a ni. Small capital chuan over-diversify suh; 1-3 company monitor thei.~Sector hrang thlang la, company hrang tam tak thlang lo. Diversification hian company-specific risk a tihtlem, market-wide risk a bo lo. Review hun rei hnu chauh sem thlak rawh.','Diversification: sum sem darh. Sector: industry group.','Ã¢â€šÂ¹900 -> 3 company @ Ã¢â€šÂ¹300, sector hrang.','Too many small positions monitoring harsa. Diversification chuan market risk a bo lo.','Monitor thei zat chauh thlang.',[Q('Diversification objective?','Company risk tlem','Market risk bo','Risk spread.','Market risk bo lo.'),Q('Small capital diversification?','1-3 company','20 company','Monitor thei.','Too many.'),Q('Sector thlan chhan?','Risk spread','Return guarantee','Industry variety.','Guarantee lo.')]);
L('Risk limit leh position size','Position size chu trade amount / total capital. Small capital chuan per-trade risk limit set rawh, e.g. capital 10%. Loss zat pawm thei hriat hmasak.~Ã¢â€šÂ¹900 capital, 10% = Ã¢â€šÂ¹90 max risk per trade. Stop-loss hman chuan loss limit a veng. Position size lian chuan emotional decision a pung.','Position size: trade amount proportion. Risk limit: max loss pawm.','Ã¢â€šÂ¹900 capital, 10% risk limit = Ã¢â€šÂ¹90 per trade max.','Position size lian chuan stress leh overreaction. Risk limit ziak loh chuan ad-hoc trade.','Risk limit hmasak ziak rawh.',[Q('Position size chu?','Trade / capital','Price','Proportion.','Price chauh a ni lo.'),Q('10% of Ã¢â€šÂ¹900?','Ã¢â€šÂ¹90','Ã¢â€šÂ¹900','Risk limit.','Full capital lo.'),Q('Large position effect?','Stress pung','Safety','Emotional.','Safety a ni lo.')]);
L('Record vawn leh review','Trade record vawn chuan mistakes hriat a pui. Date, company, side, quantity, price, reason, result ziak. Weekly review la, pattern hmuh.~Record vawn loh chuan same mistake repeat. Profit/loss chhan hriat a pawimawh. Paper Trading-ah notes field mental note atangin ziak rawh.','Trade record: trade details. Review: pattern analysis.','Record: date, VA, buy 3 @ Ã¢â€šÂ¹88, reason chart breakout, result +Ã¢â€šÂ¹6 after sell.','Memory chauh chuan bias a awm. Record loh chuan learning slow.','Record vawn chu improvement key.',[Q('Trade record hian?','Mistake hriat','Profit guarantee','Pattern analysis.','Guarantee lo.'),Q('Review frequency?','Weekly','Never','Regular.','Never review lo.'),Q('Record loh result?','Repeat mistake','Better result','No learning.','Better lo.')]);
L('No-trade decision','Trade ti loh chuan valid decision a ni. Criteria a tlin loh chuan cash vawn. Overtrading chuan fees leh mistakes a pung.~No-trade hian capital veng a, opportunity cost a awm mah se bad trade cost a tihtlem. Checklist a tlin loh chuan nghah theih. Cash vawnna pawh strategy part a ni.','No-trade: trade ti loh. Opportunity cost: missed chance.','Company hre lo, fees hre lo, budget tlem -> no-trade, cash vawn.','Trade luih chuan unnecessary loss. No-trade chu weakness a ni lo.','No-trade chu discipline a ni.',[Q('No-trade chu?','Valid decision','Weakness','Capital veng.','Weakness a ni lo.'),Q('Overtrading result?','Mistakes/fees pung','Better return','Cost increases.','Better lo.'),Q('No-trade chhan?','Criteria tlin loh','Fear only','Checklist.','Fear chauh lo.')]);
L('V1.1 zirna zawhna leh next steps','100 lessons zawh hnu chuan fundamentals, accounts, buying/selling, charts, profit/loss, corporate actions, company accounts, risk leh fraud prevention i zir zo. Paper Trading-a practice chhunzawm rawh.~Zirna zawh chu investment success guarantee a ni lo. Next step: small capital, rules, record, review. Real money hma simulation leh discipline hman. Owners acceptance hnu chauh final release.','V1.1 curriculum: 100 lessons, 10 groups. Completion: progress /100.','100 lessons zawh, 300 quiz questions. Paper Trading practice 30 days.','Certificate/quiz pass chauh chuan real investing ready a ni lo. Practice leh discipline a ngai.','Zirna chu practice nena chhunzawm rawh.',[Q('V1.1 lesson count?','100','20','Expanded curriculum.','20 a ni lo.'),Q('Quiz questions total?','300','60','3 per lesson.','60 lo.'),Q('Completion guarantee?','A ni lo','A ni','Practice a ngai.','Guarantee lo.')]);

